## Temp test scratch ##
# One glob covers every suite; the explicit list below predates it and is
# kept so an existing checkout does not suddenly show these as untracked.
# Every `loadModule` / `bundleEntry` call writes an esbuild bundle here. The
# runner clears them before each suite; this catch-all means a new label does
# not need a new line — the previous version was 40 hand-maintained entries.
tests/unit/.tmp-*/

## Research artifacts (decoded MHTML, selector maps, captures) ##
.research/
*.mhtml
*.mht

# Markdown files local-only (except README)
*.md
!README.md

# e2e screenshots are build artifacts, re-generated by `yarn test:e2e`
tests/e2e/screenshots/
